id=cmf_stereo
name=CMF Phone 1 Dual Speaker (mono / stereo)
version=v1.0.9-beta
versionCode=1090
author=Dr.Essence
description=Real left/right stereo on the CMF Phone 1 (A015) from the earpiece and the bottom speaker, following the screen when the phone is turned. Mono (stock, with Awinic speaker protection) or Stereo, switched at once from the app, stereoctl or the Action button. Patches only this phone's verified vendor files; back to mono after two failed boots.
